  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1 Bug Fixes and Improvements:\n\n\t\t  FIXED:\n\t\t  - Subscript/superscript toggle now properly removes formatting\n\t\t  - Subscript and superscript can no longer be applied simultaneously\n\n\t\t  IMPROVED:\n\t\t  - Default MaxHeight changed to 600px (industry standard, matches TinyMCE/CKEditor)\n\t\t  - Added MinHeight and MaxHeight parameters with flexible CSS unit support\n\t\t  - Internal scrollbar appears when content exceeds maximum height\n\n\t\t  DOCUMENTATION:\n\t\t  - Added @rendermode InteractiveServer requirement\n\t\t  - Documented supported render modes (Server/WebAssembly/Auto)\n\t\t  - Clarified Static SSR is not supported\n\t\t  - Added height control parameter examples\n\n\t\t  See full changelog at: https://github.com/simscon1/BlazorRTE/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
